{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">粉嶺公路有小巴與工程車相撞，近20人受傷。<br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事小巴車頭嚴重損毀，擋風玻璃碎裂，防撞杆鬆脫。車窗破裂。救援人員接報後趕到現場，多名傷者自行步上救護車。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.FL-1000_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026vlulsvVLha1790567111.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.FL-1000_002.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現場交通擠塞，有交通警指揮交通。警方上午8時許接報，指粉嶺公路往九龍方向近彩園邨，一輛小巴與一輛特別用途車相撞，近20人受輕傷、清醒送院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.FL-1000_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026yLsMiElUra1790567122.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.FL-1000_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方正調查意外原因，受事故影響，粉嶺公路往九龍方向近彩園邨一度全線封閉。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T04:58:08.390474+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}